00:00:40.723 --> 00:00:41.280
I'm eBay.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.100
You can ask me what
something is worth.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.570
URS HOLZLE: We put
a security chip

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:48.930
